    {
      "bbox": [
        271,
        1343,
        1430,
        1910
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Purpose. A number of City agencies provide\ncommunity-related services to residents of the City. Responsibility\nfor supervising and coordinating those agencies is currently divided\namong the deputy mayors. To improve the delivery of\ncommunity-related services and to facilitate the supervision and\ncoordination of the agencies which provide them, such agencies should\nbe subject to the jurisdiction of a single deputy mayor. Pursuant to\nthis Executive Order, such responsibility is given to the Deputy\nMayor for Intergovernmental Affairs.",
